# Depth model weights (2026-08-24) - moved out of git entirely (were ~115MB
# committed across android/src/main/assets/*.tflite) into models/, which is
# gitignored wholesale instead of tracked. See models/README.md for the full
# manifest (filenames, sizes, per-model acquisition/conversion instructions)
# and build.sh for how they get copied into the Android APK / Linux binary
# at build time - build.sh will fail loudly if one referenced there is
# missing, rather than silently shipping an incomplete build.
/models/*.tflite

# Model conversion artifacts
tools/Depth-Anything-V2/
tools/depth_anything_v2_weights/
tools/tflite_tmp/
tools/calibration_data.npz
tools/depth_anything_v2.onnx

# tools/model_tester/ is a desktop comparison harness (run_models.py,
# settings.json, eg_input_1.png ARE tracked) - everything below is scratch
# output reproducible by re-running it, not worth committing.
tools/model_tester/*.tflite
tools/model_tester/*_verification/
tools/model_tester/output/
tools/model_tester/__pycache__/
addons/nightfall-stream/build/
addons/nightfall-stream/build_android/
openxr_action_map.tres
*.unstripped
STEREO_COMP_LAYER_PLAN.md

